# Ice Flan's islandcycling {2} (CR 702.29e): discarding it from the hand for {2} finds the Island in the library and puts it into
# the hand. Mana Crypt's {C}{C} pays exactly, the pool ends empty, and with only Blasted Landscape's {C} it is not offered.

